{"id":"bf7570e62e6f3e21","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-subcategory.md","title":"Subcategory","display":"df-subcategory — Subcategory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-subcategory","aliases":["93-df-subcategory"],"display":"df-subcategory — Subcategory","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-subcategory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-subcategory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subcategory — Subcategory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> are category candidates with projections <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Obj}_{(-)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Obj}_{(-)}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{(-)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{(-)}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}^{(-)}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}^{(-)}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{(-)}\">\\(\\circ_{(-)}\\)</span> from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}\\)</span> is the category predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubCat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubCat}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subcategory}\\vdash\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle:\\exists A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(A,B)\\land g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(B,C))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subcategory}\\vdash\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle:\\exists A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(A,B)\\land g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(B,C))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subcategory}\\vdash\\mathrm{SubCat}_{93}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(A,B)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal D}_A=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\;(g\\circ_{\\mathcal D}f=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subcategory}\\vdash\\mathrm{SubCat}_{93}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(A,B)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal D}_A=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\;(g\\circ_{\\mathcal D}f=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both arguments must first satisfy the category axioms, and every projection now matches the exact source notation. The composable-pair set has its own name and cannot collide with the four-place predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a57fde3586b9e79c\" href=\"?note=a57fde3586b9e79c\" title=\"93-df-composition\">93-df-composition</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D$ and $\\mathcal C$ are category candidates with projections $\\mathrm{Obj}_{(-)}$, $\\mathrm{Hom}_{(-)}$, $\\mathrm{id}^{(-)}$, and $\\circ_{(-)}$ from [[93-df-category]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}$ is the category predicate of [[93-df-category]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"a57fde3586b9e79c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Both arguments must first satisfy the category axioms, and every projection now matches the exact source notation. The composable-pair set has its own name and cannot collide with the four-place predicate of [[93-df-composition]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Obj}_{(-)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{(-)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}^{(-)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ_{(-)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubCat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subcategory}\\vdash\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle:\\exists A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(A,B)\\land g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(B,C))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subcategory}\\vdash\\mathrm{SubCat}_{93}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(A,B)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal D}\\;(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal D}_A=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{CompPair}_{93}(\\mathcal D)\\;(g\\circ_{\\mathcal D}f=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1693,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["aa74a8aadef06b6c","a57fde3586b9e79c"]}